	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"109ed7d800cd35d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Refactoring & Familiarization",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-397,
			"y":-84,
			"width":595,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"4aa73a30df7c040d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Rules\n\n- ##### Be honest and grounded\n  \n- ##### Avoid wishful thinking, to have a consistent execution.\n  \n- ##### Don't get possessed by overly positive/negative complex",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-339,
			"y":-560,
			"width":480,
			"height":360
		},
		{
			"id":"c6eb74321e033ee8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Why I need to spend energy for this?\n\n- To make good long-term decision\n- To avoid accumulation of technical debt\n- client2 was too much vibecoded",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1135,
			"y":-252,
			"width":580,
			"height":228
		},
		{
			"id":"8f2357d5226f1ddd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### file structure\nnames",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-626,
			"y":426,
			"width":339,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"34d6f4d759ea4d0b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Comments\nSome have, some don't",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-630,
			"y":560,
			"width":343,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"46acaf08ba8eeb81",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Singleton Pattern\nSeparate Composition Root (separate file + Instance in name) - ONLY for composition\n\nexport const - for the rest",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-630,
			"y":700,
			"width":586,
			"height":180
		},
		{
			"id":"f7409b24eec5db2a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Interfaces/Classes/Modules\nWhich one is best to be used\nInterfaces only where they're needed (multiple implementations)\nClasses - where there's state/life cycle\nModules - stateless\n[UPDATE DEV_RULES]",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-634,
			"y":920,
			"width":588,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"b3a04bf42acd2533",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#### Redundant Types\nSometimes they don't help at all",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-241,
			"y":426,
			"width":195,
			"height":234
		},
		{
